      139.15,
      318.91,
      451.2,
      356.78
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2 : This clause amends section 3 of the National Minimum Wage of Workers Act,No. 3 of 2016 and the legal effect of the section as amended is to increase the nationalminimum monthly wage and the national minimum daily wage of a worker in any industryor service to twelve thousand five hundred rupees and five hundred rupees respectively.",
